0..67 Comment "//! Structural equality derived from a declaration\'s levitated code"
68..144 Comment "//! [Chapman-2010-gentle_art_levitation]. `Nat`\'s code is `1` for `Zero` and"
145..221 Comment "//! `var Nat` for `Succ`; `Tagged`\'s is one product of two fields, a builtin"
222..302 Comment "//! `Bool` and `Nat`. `Eq.generic(T)` reads that code — the constructor table,"
303..379 Comment "//! the product spine, a `var` as the recursion and each leaf at the type it"
380..455 Comment "//! names — into closed core the checker judges as written and the kernel"
456..536 Comment "//! replays; the derivation itself is never trusted. A family whose code takes a"
537..587 Comment "//! parameter, or a mutual pair, is refused beside"
588..653 Comment "//! `../../pathological/metaprograms/derive-eq-over-codes.gandr`."
654..657 Comment "//!"
658..707 Comment "//! - cites: [Chapman-2010-gentle_art_levitation]"
708..711 Comment "//!"
712..861 Comment "//! [Chapman-2010-gentle_art_levitation]: https://doi.org/10.1145/1863543.1863547 \"Chapman, Dagand, McBride and Morris, The Gentle Art of Levitation\""
